{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And they continued</b> — The lamed of למרות is punctuated with a kamatz gadol, because it is in the binyan of hif'il, like לצבות בטן ולמרות עיני כבודו." "<b>In the wasteland</b> — In a place of thirst. The meaning is that they rebelled against Elyon in the place where they have need for Him."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 78, :notes {0 "The verse reads ויוסיפו עוד למרות; Ibn Ezra addresses the vocalization of למרות (with kamatz on the lamed) as a hif'il infinitive construct."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:59.185867326Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}